      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"facts\" are pretty bad tho. the vote is a matter of public record, he definitely voted 'no'. if we just try to \"spin\" it without a real excuse, the reporters are gonna tear us apart for being dishonest. they'll say he doesn't actually care about the community.\n\ndon't you think we need a more specific reason? like, maybe there was something wrong with the bill itself? something we can actually point to so it doesn't just look like he's being a jerk?",
